Q3 DECISION: keep the table hand-written AND close the silent direction.
  Before this window AC-CDPIN5 only asked table -> law, so a NEW pin line in
  .gitattributes without a table row was invisible. AC-CDPIN8 now asks:
    p  every law line is covered by at least one STRICT row (fnmatch)
    q  every STRICT row is covered by exactly one law line
    r  every resolvable literal found beside a refusal code is either a
       law-covered carrier or a declared NON_CARRIER, and the set of
       unresolvable bare names must still be ['state.json', 'tech.md']

