HONEST BOUNDARY:
  1. zero payment capability and no network beyond loopback - a gate change
     moves no money; a buyer still cannot pay (no merchant id, server, domain,
     filing+ICP or miniprogram appid+secret).
  2. zero product surface, zero api surface, zero gate number: what changed is
     whether the hand-written table can silently lose its partner law line.
  3. the scan sees only these six tokens and a 20-line neighbourhood; other
     wordings, indirect references and run-time built paths are out of reach
     and are not claimed covered.
  4. NON_CARRIER is this window's measured disposition list; a future refusal
     code beside a new code file reddens arm r once and forces a review. That
     friction is intended, not a false positive.
